{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 585,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17f0cd7209249bc7d20a3519",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "绕日本一圈的凯旋parade！\\n还能顺便吃本地盒饭，一石二鸟！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d11c66f0298c3b302f1196e322d88fd2864a55119de0b5633eb06644c07c791a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "754"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be1d030adc8695c2d50ab2b1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "久等了──showtime到啰！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b6cd34aa9fe35f555120b322348142dd93d7dad709edacdfb60d41b8d5aa208",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "755"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be110a7ae70aaa0dd836fb79",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "风风才没有紧张啦！所以现在……\\n希望你不要跟风风说话啦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "15a35549fc36169180aff12c0d718498029a79b8cac5c8a2b79d80d2b1d41d42",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "756"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2bfa3e4b9d671ee3ae63def9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最后直线要是有人敢挡路……风风就在\\n那家伙屁股上留下超深的齿痕啦──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d55a314c337fb05469bfd162dc7bd346876b4e8bb8c4a249c6cae2714d7a9d0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "757"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ccfd8c6278b7cbb029115486",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "虽然她们具有相当程度的魔力，\\n但都不是我的对手呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca8a3055ad29fcd8848fb43cbfed2d82fb89a1070aee22a49cdd442db1775f56",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "758"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9eb601bed6248f679d426940",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那当然啰。就算在决赛时我也会让大家见识\\n魔法少女Sweepy的魔法。大爆炸！",
      "source_fingerprint": "04dfe5615a08608b0ab8345d26039a28238dc6b8c82b31274ef777635db4e84b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "759"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3745a4558ff424009142003d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "电池已经充电完毕。\\n……我开玩笑的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "55a0e9493a9a7cc3e86bc2bea9c34361289e15dbd89812ae704d0d6ac695cf45",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "76"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4f4220728793278f8d1100b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练员正在等待我的胜利。\\n……所以我要赢。绝对要赢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "95ca6b43add6df0fd0603a918ce88f648a6b2f8b43896740659d0d4a3bb868db",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "760"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57ed935c78bb41fa82a0fa10",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练员的1日独占券吧。\\n真想疗愈再疗愈，尽情地疗愈他～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "753b2503efc2994e58135ff212c74fd9c120dc9caf8de96bfecc94fc06ee07cf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "761"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:639f26c4ee4ca3f87c3664ca",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "今天的竞赛也会醒目地冲刺☆\\n让大家见识赛马娘偶像一路领先到底的潜力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "356df9d62048aa0c7a1c8373dd898997c08aff5f5e8da65bf211011ac365d6e7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "762"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c09d6a0c9d39424fd9d6894",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我绝对会赢，所以不能移开视线哟☆\\n要乖乖待在第一排正中央等喔～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4ee62b6e4a45e353f231fe5fcd56b0a71d275696c32464410e82e69b7e2165e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "763"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be1751a75e55630b076ed7cb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我的故事也终于来到最高潮……\\n为了有个圆满结局，我会努力的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "13d77d74f67e7257d2059c82dfeb6a99248d7937b6c339e5890e3a92baeaf7e4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "764"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5444cfe99d3704a3be27983",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我、我是……主角！？那我说不定能成为\\n英雄……不对，是一定要成为英雄！",
      "source_fingerprint": "018b628cf07fd9af4a197b79e41f3a366d4a633bd9c0d08401b53d1a50573379",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "765"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09203252a4855f55a420e084",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这可不是佐敦玩笑，而是正经的喔～\\n不过啊，该说是这次让我也认真起来了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "067201b85dc0d828f0b691e654f58354e264538f932e92aa65183a2042dc96d2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "766"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01beef029cffe2ce47027563",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "大家真的都超强的耶～唉～真是的。\\n我不想输得很难看，那就只能获胜啰～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "91a00ea0274caf4e2b1acd78522ab2693968d30484672b7f8c3c367ab36d0374",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "767"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72fe5589e82b7d63031d80c6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……根本压抑不住。\\n但没有问题……我现在感觉好极了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1321a0064c7ad137c19e01496c1a7dfd90d2d68e177bd4f98a060e0c0340465",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "768"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b61d83e824fb311c8e2312b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不会告诉任何人。\\n反正……应该有在看吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "517d349961a16251b9fd3929fbeed109eee59aad053aa081d042573a49f58973",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "769"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee6778be54a2d894a7f2f416",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有时候会和朋友一起\\n「朝咖啡厅爆进──！」。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0cf47530fd79c632e99e495d6f56392905a80e8f0a99fc3947607df4d86b151a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "77"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d9fd83cee6f758c1418028f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "跟谁啊……等赢了再考虑。\\n不先获胜就没意义了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f13dcb15e57c56f60197dfa8493020f831b180a4c4e8913f0845d2753e89580e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "770"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:420ed3dfbfe755e16d93882f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……我要赢。我会用胜利，\\n来证明自己很强。",
      "source_fingerprint": "16f712d1f204db3c55d8b9199ce71eee5d02e9fd65a760c077137dfe3a144ae7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "771"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6531b34f2d04469688c19f3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "因为有各位温暖的声援才使得花蕾开始绽放。\\n希望大家能在一旁守护花蕾盛开的瞬间！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5b7188283d4febe235bd01f5fe633706c5909b90d5f613aeb2adba675bd4931",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "772"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac848b5f23f486e1aedf961b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "虽然就算踮起脚尖也还是不够，\\n但即便如此，我还是想追上大家！",
      "source_fingerprint": "28220b643431f80302071d8304c41fb202a852a7b20185c85747687632f0953c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "773"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e0388e5da9ce83f20252331",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这个嘛，我想要美国人在电视上说的\\n那个叫「小萝卜」的胡萝卜──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "776ba1ae8120f48a9464f49c4c673e5330f612ff71c62175767a6580ccbd2d3d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "774"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e88e773b053eaae18df75d7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "唔～蜜册是什么？怎么办──我没有耶！\\n没有就不能参加决赛吗！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e9061adfbb2c3a5ece874d02c64364aa14fa28ca6aa9c317b3352b02f30a6a8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "775"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d67d006d1ebb2a43e6203290",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有句话说「赛马娘，一入闸门便有七敌」，\\n所以每个人都是劲敌！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "20ef7f8fc8578115378c159b0bc058c5fef6222fa7a631c959ae9d2ac98fae04",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "776"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b76b1b9fbc48bbaa4950683c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "交给我吧！\\n呃嗯，我会像爆竹一样狂奔的──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2158a5ea888b3760f88a8dbedf94a8a3a9343412952efe50329eff493ee44f9d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "777"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5084a318d95382d0b673423",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "ああ、まるでヒーローショーみたいだ……\\nピンチの時は応援よろしく頼む！",
      "source_fingerprint": "25937e356df896cb9500e8afcea848ad8bbc7d05b0fb75ac129d56460e565f7e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "778"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:269301d9b7c2713b5a73d9a1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "戦い続けるのみさ……。\\nそう、この世にレースがある限りッ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5bd397b5eba10b332088310f1b71251c053ccc89706b14dcc9018c31931e008",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "779"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30e90e5b40800c285681c1fa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "内存内是这么纪录着的，\\n「每一场都是蕴含庞大热能的激战」。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a6f684bb2306b3a7d57ae93e3bef49a642fccd3b2e5b26c230a160331e07e92",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "78"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:afdc9746d8ada86596276f2b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "真是美丽☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "75bafc61348b902c9dd1e5d672c19d1cef2a9842aa259500df190a35cce59f36",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "780"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7c92155992166667059e63a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯嗯！尽～量期待吧！\\n我会将美丽传递给大家☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c4a4ba32f0066cb54c1fd2916508f5c7c97173fdda147d2f24b1795915e2a23",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "781"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5d672d70e02ec08cc894a78",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请收下这个「能与幽灵和肩膀酸痛成为朋友的\\n护身符」！这样就会变成甜蜜的负担吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "58f19653df14c7eb942941a131ee9827b4eda7d0733d1bd6e090dde1b182761f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "782"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:668f18ab5e67370fa2d1adba",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "运气！以及努力！于是我做完了\\n百次参拜！现在的我无懈可击！",
      "source_fingerprint": "21241b31dbe02baa525c6755966c738fb11c64959a53fad41f019a6f13b954df",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "783"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17994f3b9728e1fe1e71d419",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "因为欢呼声让人心旷神怡，我就忍不住睡了个\\n午觉，结果睡过头了。多亏如此我精神超好！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b0221296f02ad2fbbb37f3fecd2bc6b9c9698adb636ff39c307edd6daa6f5ec",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "784"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6108bdc29e6fcd8f6cae9dc6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这样啊，必须好好感谢呢。\\n不过我会照自己的风格去跑，仅此而已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "99c1ca0fa2de47d035583d8f851f6096fe85c74e0d8254ac3d3720b695d45f4e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "785"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1f02616c910138dacb0433e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是，是的～为了不要妨碍到大家，\\n我会悄悄地第1个抵达终点……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e2dfe675a62a315af294be2a551344c4b392b959f7a9f0064affb4c85163aa9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "786"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f9ca0317c3ce0009a63cee0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "虽然像我这样的人，可能最后还是办不到，\\n但还是要相信会有救赎──啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2aa0810556117575e870cda1299941dee97b1b5c159a4c784bc784bd8aa78800",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "787"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fce28d99c4ee70475027184a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "完全没有……如果是以前的我应该会\\n这样么说吧。但现在……我稍微有点自信了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "269c16d41e992e98d309a029f1c89e888d3ccaa38f17e68989da223bfddd567a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "788"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22520de44cfdf48516bee6aa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……请看着吧──看着我的表现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7b1d1a000a02dd94d4cb4a57c28002e1c299e7e23a79fa5dd857a7b8b9eb5b2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "789"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8dab3b9b6148df0280735e6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这个问题很难回答。腰大肌、内收肌群\\n和臀部肌群都很重要喔！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2263b2a7dc816d3eac9aeb8daa50ee27878b1a187eb035b0358c8ccd29b5243",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "79"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf194a1958d434dea29e5bec",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯──渔网吧？鱼的营养均衡，\\n而且年年有余也能带来好兆头～",
      "source_fingerprint": "7cf3ecc71cbd4114cd18ca2939e17327d717d6226dec1bf09363c3c1b057296f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "790"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66c430c24f0f9b6439e29b3f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "希望能上榜就好了……\\n锁定的名次……跟大家一样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3d8fed6c83a09455f218e9c6c4c7c3f3e7411f04a0d5b72af4d72f1b08dd0de",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "791"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a3c1c887bcc3948f329a8e2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我会用自己的方式让你们认同。\\n……一定会！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d14458818fa8883e1d8b5ec7b2b9b30c77125e4760ca3cb60af61f3d018af323",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "792"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:760581b56168090cfbdb5f9d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "身为一流这是理所当然的。等着看我获得优胜\\n并成为超一流的赛马娘吧！哦──呵呵呵！",
